  "details": "So, the shield settings there should include a setting where we can mute ourselves to certain people in VRChat. Example! You can set the shield setting for visitors so they cannot hear you, or  known or trusted. So we would be in a world, and in that world, if we have the setting on, they cannot hear us.  We can turn it on in the small menu like where the show avatar buttons is so you can also individually also allow a person to hear you!  This also will help people who ease drop in the game! I get that its a social game and people should hear you talk. But certain people dont want people hearing them, or they are even just comfy talking to just there friends. I also know they is a mute button to mute certain people and you can block people but again there is people who legit will sit there and record and you wont even know so i think this would be a perfect way to help. I think it should be in! Not sure if this is already in the game lmk! Have a wonderful day!",
